  "validation_domain": "1512 exact original ARM/C++ comparisons. Fx 36 predicates, GEQ 54, channel tag432, alt42, Smaart828; 24 forwarding cases for each of five exact wrappers. Para/Comp/unknown, nulls, case-sensitive/prefix strings, signed channel indices, mismatched tags, user bit6 and unrelated flags; real CCL controller/child registration, casting, parameter edit/change notifications, and derived virtual override argument preservation.",
  "limitations": [
    "Portable source adaptation to actual CCL 5.0.0 IStorageFilter bool returns and inheritance; original return declarations, class layouts, construction, ownership and ARM ABI remain unverified. No constructor/destructor identity credited.",
    "Native libc/ConstString/getController/RTTI calls use explicit bounded hooks; only original application instructions execute. No firmware Core recovered. Native stack writes and dependency traces retained; no nonstack writes observed.",
    "ChannelParameterController is an explicit typed CCL Component adapter around a canonical ChannelComponent reference and stable signed index. CCL owns its registered parameters/children; referenced channel and ParamInfo lifetime must outlive them. Original ChannelComponent layout/inheritance not claimed.",
    "Smaart eq/null component is invalid native domain; portable defensive false is unvalidated outside that domain. Original component controller relationship is source-ported through actual CCL getParent and typed ChannelParameterController.",
    "Test-only ChannelApplicationServices stubs are unused boundaries; no hardware, sockets, firmware update or system-call passthrough. Allocation failure, exceptions, concurrent mutation and devices untested."
